30,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It seems we are billed by area, not headcount, and moving power is quite expensive per desk.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The noise is much louder by the door, and the physio says it takes days to get a chair right.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"Setting up every morning takes up to nine minutes, and past shuffles caused weeks of interruptions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Daylight is a major complaint, and our arrival times vary wildly from 8 AM to 10 AM.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Sitting near each other helped project handovers and helped the new joiners learn the unwritten rules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, those interruptions sound costly. @Minato, the physical setup time is a concern if we move often.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Minato,,"Yes, I worry about the noise and the chairs.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, exactly. The time lost to ""small"" changes adds up quickly.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"If we go for a first-come basis, the early birds always get the windows.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,But we gain so much by being close.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"We need a balance between cost, stability, and collaboration.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Minato,,I just want a quiet spot that doesn't hurt my back.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,Stability seems key to avoid those fortnight-long disruptions.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,We can't ignore that some seats are objectively worse than others.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shunichi, maybe we can decide the grouping together?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let's consider the options carefully.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
