55,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Option A is stable and budget-friendly. Option B is fair but expensive to implement. Option C is flexible but chaotic.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A lets me keep my chair and a quiet spot. I prefer A.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,May,,Option C sounds like a nightmare for my schedule and the morning routine. I vote A.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B solves the ""bad seat"" problem, but the badge records make C unfair. I'll go with B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option A keeps us together for learning, but B also does that. I think A is safest.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shunichi, is the fairness of B worth the cost of re-running power every time we shift?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Minato,,I don't like the idea of moving my equipment.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,May,,Neither do I. The interruptions are too much.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"It is a trade-off, but resentment over window seats is real.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I think we can just agree on the layout for A.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. A is the most rational choice for the budget and stability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Minato,,I'm staying with A.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,May,,A for me too.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If everyone else is against it, B might be a hard sell.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I vote A.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,4,talk,Victoria,,It seems we have a consensus.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
